  {
   "id": "elex-ii-55147@3",
   "gameId": "elex-ii-55147",
   "displayName": "Patch 3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-03-22T10:47:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have just launched the 3rd patch for Elex II.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here are the patch notes -",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed unwanted dialog break ups, which could cause potential plotstoppers",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed wrong behaviour of Eva if Jax has committed a crime",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Gregor, who had strange behaviour after completing the \"What doesn’t kill\" you quest",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed plot killers with some main characters who died by mistake",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed incorrect kill quest amounts of targets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed plot killer at the gates of the main former, which remained closed after completing the main quest at this point",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed situation, where Tilas and Marwin could not get back to work after their conversation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some key bindings issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a situation, where Irissa could not talk to Jax after she has spoken to Skibor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please notice: In some cases where Skibor wasn't moving in front of the gates, he should now walk straight to Irissa. This might take a while and during this state Irissa won't talk to Jax. Just wait after Skibor reaches her and both had their smalltalk.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed certain items, that could not be picked",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some linguistic errors",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prices were displayed in quantity popup and total cost did not match the actual price with the haggler skill",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed parts of the destruction bar were visible on teach screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed flickering of occluded highlighted objects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed damage value for plasma cannon MK 2 Normal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed wrong behaviour of Vivian due to committed crimes by Jax in certain areas",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grenade launchers are craftable now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug, where vegetation on meshes were missing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug in Jax's hitpoints by adding and removing constitution points",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed climbing issue, no jump when evading after hanging on a ledge",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed climbing issue, let go when pressing the evade button",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed deadly weather zones, no more resistances into account",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed rushed movements, when the target is not reachable",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed improper loot of one of Craig's bandits",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Holding a shield will no longer make the back immune to projectiles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug, Jax might be unable to speak to Caja or she will not join back to the Sixth Power",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug, where Crony stayed in combat after a teleport",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a situation, where Vakis might get stuck at the gates of the Fort",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Khan is not stuck anymore after the dialog with Asmir in certain situations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Savety fix for the 6th Power sub quests were not given when interacting with Adam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed problems, when Jax was hit while lockpicking",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bugfix for \"Text” may be displayed instead of icons, when the training menu is opened the first time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed improper cancel option during the end screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug, where user were able to upgrade any weapon without losing the two copies needed in the upgrading process",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed incorrect behaviour of Tilas after smalltalk with Vakis",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Voice of Khan not interacting with Jax after he has spoken to Ruben and fulfilled his duty",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added safety mechanism for Skibor if he did not go to Irissa after he had guided Jax to the depot",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed wrong item name appearing, when pickpocketing a NPC",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted ditch check if subtitles should be visible if voice and text language are the same",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added safety mechanism for NPCs with problem to continue their routine after cutscenes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always if you have any issues make sure to join our discord at discord.gg/elex and follow the bug reporting list here - https://steamcommunity.com/app/900040/discussions/0/3190242182151476977/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
